, :shotlist.episode11.bn/type "dialogue", :shotlist.episode11.bn/speaker "pico", :shotlist.episode11.bn/text "পিছু নেবে না!?", :shotlist.episode11.bn/shiro_emo "sad", :shotlist.episode11.bn/pico_emo "surprised", :shotlist.episode11.bn/sfx nil, :shotlist.episode11.bn/fx nil} {:db/id -49, :shotlist.episode11.bn/type "dialogue", :shotlist.episode11.bn/speaker "shiro", :shotlist.episode11.bn/text "…পারব না। এখন নয়।", :shotlist.episode11.bn/shiro_emo "sad", :shotlist.episode11.bn/pico_emo "sad", :shotlist.episode11.bn/sfx nil, :shotlist.episode11.bn/fx nil} {:db/id -50, :shotlist.episode11.bn/type "scene", :shotlist.episode11.bn/scene_key "ghost_reveal", :shotlist.episode11.bn/scene_prompt "The faceless Ghost silhouette dissolving back into white heat particles, and at the instant of vanishing a single teal mote of light glows within its outline then fades, ominous and mysterious, cyber neon", :shotlist.episode11.bn/sfx "ghost", :shotlist.episode11.bn/fx "flash", :shotlist.episode11.bn/dur 3.5} {:db/id -51, :shotlist.episode11.bn/type "dialogue", :shotlist.episode11.bn/speaker "pico", :shotlist.episode11.bn/text "SHIRO। ওটার ভেতরে—ফিরোজা, আলো।", :shotlist.episode11.bn/shiro_emo "surprised", :shotlist.episode11.bn/pico_emo "surprised", :shotlist.episode11.bn/sfx nil, :shotlist.episode11.bn/fx nil} {:db/id -52, :shotlist.episode11.bn/type "dialogue", :shotlist.episode11.bn/speaker "shiro", :shotlist.episode11.bn/text "…তুমিও দেখলে?", :shotlist.episode11.bn/shiro_emo "surprised", :shotlist.episode11.bn/pico_emo "normal", :shotlist.episode11.bn/sfx nil, :shotlist.episode11.bn/fx nil} {:db/id -53, :shotlist.episode11.bn/type "dialogue", :shotlist.episode11.bn/speaker "shiro", :shotlist.episode11.bn/text "তথ্য ভৌত। মুছে গেলেও, চিহ্ন সবসময় থেকে যায়।", :shotlist.episode11.bn/shiro_emo "thinking", :shotlist.episode11.bn/pico_emo "normal", :shotlist.episode11.bn/sfx nil, :shotlist.episode11.bn/fx nil} {:db/id -54, :shotlist.episode11.bn/type "dialogue", :shotlist.episode11.bn/speaker "shiro", :shotlist.episode11.bn/text "Ghost যত command বদলেছে, সব ফিরিয়ে দেব।", :shotlist.episode11.bn/shiro_emo "normal", :shotlist.episode11.bn/pico_emo "normal", :shotlist.episode11.bn/sfx nil, :shotlist.episode11.bn/fx nil} {:db/id -55, :shotlist.episode11.bn/type "dialogue", :shotlist.episode11.bn/speaker "pico", :shotlist.episode11.bn/text "কৌশল, Heat-Memory Restore!", :shotlist.episode11.bn/shiro_emo "normal", :shotlist.episode11.bn/pico_emo "happy", :shotlist.episode11.bn/sfx "whoosh", :shotlist.episode11.bn/fx "flash"} {:db/id -56, :shotlist.episode11.bn/type "scene", :shotlist.episode11.bn/scene_key "info_layer", :shotlist.episode11.bn/scene_prompt "Streams of white heat particles flowing into server racks, overwritten commands restoring to original form, teal restore-light spreading across the data layer, cyber neon recovery glow", :shotlist.episode11.bn/sfx "chime", :shotlist.episode11.bn/fx "flash", :shotlist.episode11.bn/dur 3.0} {:db/id -57, :shotlist.episode11.bn/type "dialogue", :shotlist.episode11.bn/speaker "shiro", :shotlist.episode11.bn/text "কৌশল, Full-Spectrum Scan—সব তুলে নেব।", :shotlist.episode11.bn/shiro_emo "normal", :shotlist.episode11.bn/pico_emo "happy", :shotlist.episode11.bn/sfx "chime", :shotlist.episode11.bn/fx "flash"} {:db/id -58, :shotlist.episode11.bn/type "scene", :shotlist.episode11.bn/scene_key "info_layer", :shotlist.episode11.bn/scene_prompt "Plant-wide teal scan light sweeping across the whole facility, every spot the Ghost touched lighting up as white heat afterimages, altered values and fake commands all exposed, cyber neon", :shotlist.episode11.bn/sfx "chime", :shotlist.episode11.bn/fx "flash", :shotlist.episode11.bn/dur 3.0} {:db/id -59, :shotlist.episode11.bn/type "dialogue", :shotlist.episode11.bn/speaker "pico", :shotlist.episode11.bn/text "ঠিক আছে!", :shotlist.episode11.bn/shiro_emo "normal", :shotlist.episode11.bn/pico_emo "happy", :shotlist.episode11.bn/sfx "whoosh", :shotlist.episode11.bn/fx nil} {:db/id -60, :shotlist.episode11.bn/type "dialogue", :shotlist.episode11.bn/speaker "shiro", :shotlist.episode11.bn/text "—Double Remanence Reset!", :shotlist.episode11.bn/shiro_emo "normal", :shotlist.episode11.bn/pico_emo "happy", :shotlist.episode11.bn/sfx "chime", :shotlist.episode11.bn/fx "flash"} {:db/id -61, :shotlist.episode11.bn/type "dialogue", :shotlist.episode11.bn/speaker "pico", :shotlist.episode11.bn/text "—Double Remanence Reset!", :shotlist.episode11.bn/shiro_emo "happy", :shotlist.episode11.bn/pico_emo "happy", :shotlist.episode11.bn/sfx "chime", :shotlist.episode11.bn/fx "flash"} {:db/id -62, :shotlist.episode11.bn/type "scene", :shotlist.episode11.bn/scene_key "plant_restored", :shotlist.episode11.bn/scene_prompt "Teal and white light merging in a ripple across the whole geothermal plant, red values reverting to normal, pipe pressure easing, steam settling, alarms silenced, triumphant cyber neon dawn", :shotlist.episode11.bn/sfx "ambient", :shotlist.episode11.bn/fx "flash", :shotlist.episode11.bn/dur 3.5} {:db/id -63, :shotlist.episode11.bn/type "scene", :shotlist.episode11.bn/scene_key "geothermal_plant_dawn", :shotlist.episode11.bn/scene_prompt "Exterior plant wall at brightening dawn, two small chibi hero silhouettes sitting side by side on the wall, steam columns flushed with morning light, calm teal sky, quiet aftermath", :shotlist.episode11.bn/sfx "ambient", :shotlist.episode11.bn/fx nil, :shotlist.episode11.bn/dur 3.0} {:db/id -64, :shotlist.episode11.bn/type "dialogue", :shotlist.episode11.bn/speaker "pico", :shotlist.episode11.bn/text "…SHIRO। Ghost, শক্তিশালী ছিল, না।", :shotlist.episode11.bn/shiro_emo "sad", :shotlist.episode11.bn/pico_emo "sad", :shotlist.episode11.bn/sfx nil, :shotlist.episode11.bn/fx nil} {:db/id -65, :shotlist.episode11.bn/type "dialogue", :shotlist.episode11.bn/speaker "shiro", :shotlist.episode11.bn/text "হুম।", :shotlist.episode11.bn/shiro_emo "sad", :shotlist.episode11.bn/pico_emo "sad", :shotlist.episode11.bn/sfx nil, :shotlist.episode11.bn/fx nil} {:db/id -66, :shotlist.episode11.bn/type "dialogue", :shotlist.episode11.bn/speaker "pico", :shotlist.episode11.bn/text "…SHIRO-ও জিততে পারে না?", :shotlist.episode11.bn/shiro_emo "sad", :shotlist.episode11.bn/pico_emo "sad", :shotlist.episode11.bn/sfx nil, :shotlist.episode11.bn/fx nil} {:db/id -67, :shotlist.episode11.bn/type "dialogue", :shotlist.episode11.bn/speaker "shiro", :shotlist.episode11.bn/text "Ghost, মুছতে বড্ড দক্ষ।", :shotlist.episode11.bn/shiro_emo "thinking", :shotlist.episode11.bn/pico_emo "sad", :shotlist.episode11.bn/sfx nil, :shotlist.episode11.bn/fx nil} {:db/id -68, :shotlist.episode11.bn/type "dialogue", :shotlist.episode11.bn/speaker "shiro", :shotlist.episode11.bn/text "কিন্তু পুরোপুরি মোছে না। একদিন নিশ্চয়ই দেখা যাবে।", :shotlist.episode11.bn/shiro_emo "normal", :shotlist.episode11.bn/pico_emo "normal", :shotlist.episode11.bn/sfx nil, :shotlist.episode11.bn/fx nil} {:db/id -69, :shotlist.episode11.bn/type "dialogue", :shotlist.episode11.bn/speaker "pico", :shotlist.episode11.bn/text "ওটা আসলে কী ছিল। ওই আলোটা।", :shotlist.episode11.bn/shiro_emo "thinking", :shotlist.episode11.bn/pico_emo "thinking", :shotlist.episode11.bn/sfx nil, :shotlist.episode11.bn/fx nil} {:db/id -70, :shotlist.episode11.bn/type "dialogue", :shotlist.episode11.bn/speaker "shiro", :shotlist.episode11.bn/text "…আমিও, এখনও জানি না।", :shotlist.episode11.bn/shiro_emo "thinking", :shotlist.episode11.bn/pico_emo "thinking", :shotlist.episode11.bn/sfx nil, :shotlist.episode11.bn/fx nil} {:db/id -71, :shotlist.episode11.bn/type "dialogue", :shotlist.episode11.bn/speaker "pico", :shotlist.episode11.bn/text "আগে আমি logs মুছতে দারুণ ছিলাম। যাতে কেউ ধরতে না পারে।", :shotlist.episode11.bn/shiro_emo "normal", :shotlist.episode11.bn/pico_emo "sad", :shotlist.episode11.bn/sfx nil, :shotlist.episode11.bn/fx nil} {:db/id -72, :shotlist.episode11.bn/type "dialogue", :shotlist.episode11.bn/speaker "pico", :shotlist.episode11.bn/text "…কিন্তু আজ, কিছু